{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8001_p", "source_sha256": "c4e35fed235871c726b988d079465418c592802fcb4b87562573127e7e6dccb3", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\n星梨花のテーマは『令和ギャル』だ！）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。\n星梨花的主题是“令和辣妹”！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8002_022ser", "source_sha256": "271af9c7381363728c9b217f9e0841c37e4b0eda438f4f4bac31d3e597ab5b65", "ja": "パパにこのお仕事のことを話したら、「ギャルには\nならないでくれ」って言われちゃいました……。", "zh": "我把这份工作的事告诉爸爸后，爸爸对我说：“可千万别变成辣妹啊。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8003_p", "source_sha256": "edf7b3462ba6a7a7fe8eb81913126c7d5818f6ca88c400d8d0e6d2be7aa98253", "ja": "そうか……。まあ、派手に見えたりするところも\nあるから、心配したのかもしれないな……。", "zh": "这样啊……毕竟有些地方看起来可能比较花哨，他也许是担心你吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8004_022ser", "source_sha256": "baf9c189b5e0ee9b84da27190264830000534e40adb09c2cf419480d9e412eb8", "ja": "はい……。でもわたし、この服はかわいいと思います。\nだからお仕事も、最後までやってみたいんです。", "zh": "是……不过，我觉得这件衣服很可爱。\n所以这次的工作，我也想努力做到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8005_022ser", "source_sha256": "4e989025c6dd1ac1470aa7612f09915ff472854f9413e7cbba85ca1cde4dc6c8", "ja": "パパも喜んでくれるって思ったのに……。\nどうすれば、ギャルの良さが伝わるでしょうか？", "zh": "我还以为爸爸也会高兴的……。\n要怎样才能让他感受到辣妹的魅力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8006", "source_sha256": "c9eab55441775a4fc27da25eebb4cdf89e8bc23f64a415b9f31337a8689334d9", "ja": "自撮り写真を送る", "zh": "发送自拍照", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8007", "source_sha256": "55c08eb55826e94fad0cddd4b137bb09259206718bf118bc8fcaf24d07be3303", "ja": "動画を送る", "zh": "发送视频", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8008", "source_sha256": "9ec61eb9bc37e604482118675018a9ea78c4bf2ad2eb0de0050bce556132636a", "ja": "メールを送る", "zh": "发送邮件", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e3fb4e0cda987aa1f610c91ea70f6b9dc8f24b1fa7f8140141ff4e23fe811591", "ja": "自撮り写真を送るのはどうだ？　可愛く盛れた写真を\n見たら、お父さんの考えも変わるかもしれない。", "zh": "要不要发张自拍？爸爸看到你拍得可爱又上镜的照片，说不定会改变想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8101_022ser", "source_sha256": "04da7d25560beb4787d2e205e5bdf1cb5541397c18733f1ae76723ede70bcb21", "ja": "そうですね！　今のわたしの姿を見たら、\nきっとパパもわかってくれますよね！", "zh": "对呀！如果爸爸看到现在的我，一定也会理解我的，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8102_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c635e658b483de3e32b655a2120ab2cbc7bc526fd682e3f0f5346d436eadeee", "ja": "写真を盛るアプリ？も、一度使ってみたかったんです！\nえへへ。ギャルになったみたいで、楽しいですね♪", "zh": "修图软件？我也一直想试试看呢！\n嘿嘿，感觉自己变成辣妹了，好开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8200_p", "source_sha256": "1ad08e6a03473161d6447f59c1822b06165729b19ee6e692f388cbe23b9db5f0", "ja": "動画はどうだ？　流行りのショート動画をマネしたら\n星梨花の可愛さも一緒に伝わると思うんだ。", "zh": "短视频怎么样？要是模仿现在流行的短视频，我觉得也能把星梨花的可爱一起传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8201_022ser", "source_sha256": "177a8ab0bbc949dcf1cc1bd8743523b0f3e05a311de350b870c1df1aa8d2a39f", "ja": "ショート動画……。もしかして、かわいい動物が\n出てくる動画ですか？　それなら、よく見てますよ！", "zh": "短视频……难道是那种有可爱动物出镜的视频吗？那种视频的话，我经常看的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8202_022ser", "source_sha256": "1cac71e7e9aa6c72226d7cc16ba29d68ebd66f50623521c3e113fce3a063e68e", "ja": "パパも、ニコニコしながら見てるんです。よーし……\n{$P$}さんも手伝ってくださいね♪", "zh": "爸爸也会笑眯眯地看呢。好——\n{$P$}先生也请帮帮忙哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8300_p", "source_sha256": "8744aefdbf786935c7d86fcfb06df92e3a3bda2f6018884be674c5b72f55db3b", "ja": "メールで伝えてみるのはどうだ？　ギャル文字で\n魅力を伝えたら、お父さんもわかってくれるかも。", "zh": "要不要试着用邮件传达一下？用辣妹文字。  \n如果能用它传达魅力的话，说不定爸爸也会理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8301_022ser", "source_sha256": "e5d1568c2fc962c1934ffda14dc168019a335738553b1141fa45d45d162398bf", "ja": "ギャル文字、ですか？\nそれでパパに魅力が伝わるなら……やってみます！", "zh": "辣妹文字吗？\n如果能通过这个把魅力传达给爸爸……我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_022ser_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_022ser_8302_022ser", "source_sha256": "2eb80a813d0964891e699521977f78ef573b13a71c791af4dfb3bd121c0ca294", "ja": "でも、ギャル文字ってどんな言葉でしょう……？\n{$P$}さんは知ってますか？", "zh": "不过，辣妹文字究竟是什么样的语言呢……？\n{$P$}先生知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
